        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><span class="tanda-chip chip-manana">🌅 Mañana</span></td>
                <td><strong>11:00 AM</strong></td><td>11:00 AM</td><td>12:00 PM</td><td>11:00 AM</td><td>10:00 AM</td><td>9:00 AM</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><span class="tanda-chip chip-tarde">☀️ Tarde</span></td>
                <td><strong>3:00 PM</strong></td><td>3:00 PM</td><td>4:00 PM</td><td>3:00 PM</td><td>2:00 PM</td><td>1:00 PM</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><span class="tanda-chip chip-noche">🌙 Noche</span></td>
                <td><strong>9:00 PM</strong></td><td>9:00 PM</td><td>10:00 PM</td><td>9:00 PM</td><td>8:00 PM</td><td>7:00 PM</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <p><em>Honduras y Costa Rica comparten la zona horaria UTC-6. Los horarios de EE.UU. pueden variar en ±1 hora durante el horario de verano.</em></p>
</section>

